nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VL5Jz-ly_hAQ7kNvwG3yhpQ&_nc_oc=Adqeb9znUFajlNC4VWZG1Yvt_uWpO56_gfummINpK-Hx3g1E0nCMr_3YntY7I-nQ8fk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxXhZpX-9fRhZ9oXb-F8ggcXy2F9umPPTXq_pe9_QN3bw&oe=69C3CCE4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "879363444937419", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307315_879363448270752_400143134733280957_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8MCIfnBowLYQ7kNvwH5mkuX&_nc_oc=AdqD4CdcJ6xgVWAWkoSHPIawD6Kba4R1otMF6gQvrs0mUQPIpHdsr3fy8kJhgo08vpU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afys_gFgnx4maLGvM03jAM5infZjGopTKmVcWyeBbWDEwA&oe=69C3E8B4"}, "display_name": "Ape Skate Shootout", "keywords": ["shooter", "fps", "ape", "skate", "hangout"], "long_description": "Shoot. Skate. Toot. \n\nCome hang out at the Skate Park, where you can slide down half pipes and pull off sweet tricks while hanging out with your friends - and grab a gun to mow them down. \n\nIn Ape Skate Shootout you can : \n- Complete skateboard tricks and stunts to earn SkateCash, used to upgrade your character or the Skate Park itself\n- Charge your farts observing your gas meter, and use them to boost around the Skate Park (or to disrespect your fallen foes). \n- Find a variety of weapons to mow down other players and compete in tense deathmatches\n- Combine wacky gadgets and upgrade combos to become the sickest Ape on the half-pipe. \n- Private and public lobby codes to join friends easier\n\nFeaturing a unique locomotion system that's easy to learn and difficult to master, and simple gunplay mechanics with a varied upgrade system, every match of Ape Skate Shootout will feel completely different. ", "short_description": "Kick Ass and Pass Gas - Shoot, skate and toot your way around the Skate Park pulling off tricks and eliminating your opponents. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_